==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nb}} {{m|non|auga}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nb}} {{m|gem-pro|*augô}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|nb}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₃ekʷ-||eye; to see}}.

===Noun===
{{head|nb|noun|g=n|definite singular|øyet|indefinite plural|øyne|or|øyer|definite plural|øynene|or|øyene|or|øya}}

# {{lb|nb|anatomy}} an [[eye]]
#: ''et [[blått]] '''øye''' - a [[black eye]]''
#: ''med det blotte '''øye''' - with the [[naked eye]]''
# [[eye]] (''hole in a needle'')

